{"4517340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PATCHED", "steam_appid": 4517340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517340/extras/86a3b9ff74930db1d23f97bfb8649f72.avif?t=1779708023\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PATCHED</i></strong><i> </i>is about a lonely, abandoned doll who awakens in an empty, decrepit factory. In search of answers, they begin to explore the factory and piece themselves back together, encountering other dolls along the way. As they <strong><i>stitch</i></strong><i> </i>together the dark truth behind their connection to the factory and its origins, the doll is met with the ultimate choice: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will they attempt to mend the factory and its denizens?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Or will they <strong>burn</strong> it all away?<strong></strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PATCHED is a blend of platforming, puzzle, and adventure, where you play as a broken doll escaping this haunted factory. As you explore this worn-down factory, you collect parts to rebuild your body and unlock abilities like sewing, grappling, and parrying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid corrupted dolls and use defensive tools to survive as you uncover the truth behind your creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and Timing Sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517340/extras/86a3b9ff74930db1d23f97bfb8649f72.avif?t=1779708023\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PATCHED</i></strong><i> </i>is about a lonely, abandoned doll who awakens in an empty, decrepit factory. In search of answers, they begin to explore the factory and piece themselves back together, encountering other dolls along the way. As they <strong><i>stitch</i></strong><i> </i>together the dark truth behind their connection to the factory and its origins, the doll is met with the ultimate choice: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will they attempt to mend the factory and its denizens?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Or will they <strong>burn</strong> it all away?<strong></strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PATCHED is a blend of platforming, puzzle, and adventure, where you play as a broken doll escaping this haunted factory. As you explore this worn-down factory, you collect parts to rebuild your body and unlock abilities like sewing, grappling, and parrying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid corrupted dolls and use defensive tools to survive as you uncover the truth behind your creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and Timing Sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental Puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "PATCHED is about a lonely, abandoned doll who awakens in an empty, decrepit factory. In search of answers, they begin to explore the factory and piece themselves back together, encountering other dolls along the way.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Span